units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data initial.data
pair_style e3gnn
pair_coeff * * model.pt Li O P
neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time temp pe etotal press
run 0
write_dump all custom zero.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id
